%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 783b5b6aa362bcf128fa19563a0dde7b, type: 3}
  m_Name: BossLineSet
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VARG.Humor.BossLineSet
  _correctCaptureLines:
  - Target logged. Look at that, the intern can actually read. Wonders never cease.
  - Specimen bagged. One cell closer to filling my monthly spreadsheet quota.
  - Acceptable. Keep this up and I might consider unlocking the break room vending
    machine.
  - Miraculously correct. Research & Development won't have an excuse to file an
    HR complaint today.
  - "Logged into cargo. Don't get cocky, rookie\u2014you're still getting the minimum
    credit stipend."
  _outOfOrderCaptureLines:
  - '{captured}?! Did I ask you to abduct your mother?! Stick to the spreadsheet
    sequence, rookie!'
  - A {captured} right now?! You just corrupted column B! The unpaid intern before
    you at least knew how to count to three!
  - Out of order! I explicitly highlighted cell C4 in yellow! Do Earthlings have
    color blindness or just general incompetence?!
  - Sequence broken! That {captured} goes into the next batch! My blood pressure
    just broke orbital velocity!
  - Wrong order! You're making me manually sort this data table in Excel, and I don't
    get paid overtime for that!
  _notInListCaptureLines:
  - '{captured}?! That species is strictly FORBIDDEN! Are you trying to get our division
    audited by the Galactic Union?!'
  - Why is there a {captured} in my cargo hold?! If intergalactic labor inspectors
    see this, my quarterly bonus is incinerated!
  - A forbidden {captured}?! Drop that biohazard right now before I bill your family
    for the hazardous disposal fee!
  - I expressly banned {captured}! One more illegal specimen and I'm charging you
    for the ship's oxygen subscription!
  - Diplomatic catastrophe! You just abducted an unsanctioned {captured}! Quick,
    throw it out before HR drafts a write-up!
  _correctCageLines:
  - Right habitat. The smell in cargo is finally dropping to acceptable legal thresholds.
  - Specimen secured according to Galactic ISO-9001 regulations. How painfully bureaucratic.
  - In the cage. Congratulations on doing the bare minimum requirement of your job
    description.
  - Target locked in. One less lawsuit waiting to happen during transit.
  _wrongCageLines:
  - You shoved a {captured} into the wrong cage! If they cross-breed, I'll have to
    fill out 40 pages of genetic incident reports!
  - Wrong cage! That creature was about to turn your quota into its lunch! Repairs
    are coming out of your paycheck!
  - Wrong habitat, idiot! Stop mixing species before the Galactic Health Administration
    shuts down our wing!
  - Are you blind?! Put the {captured} in its assigned pen before I reassign you
    to toxic waste filtration!
  _correctDiscardLines:
  - Recycled. Unsanctioned biomass shredded without leaving a paper trail. Clean
    work.
  - Straight to the incinerator. If anyone asks, that specimen never legally existed.
  - Shredded. Dead weight removed, ship fuel efficiency restored by 0.002%.
  _wrongDiscardLines:
  - You just threw our mission target into the incinerator?! YOU DISINTEGRATED COMPANY
    QUOTA, MORON!
  - Stop dumping our profit margins into the shredder! I will literally deduct that
    {captured} from your soul!
  - You incinerated a verified quota specimen! My career just flashed before my ocular
    sensory organs!
  - That was an approved abduction, not garbage! I'm canceling your weekend and debiting
    your life insurance!
  _victoryLines:
  - Quota achieved! I'm putting my name on the header of this report and telling
    Central Command I did it all myself.
  - Mission complete. Punch your time card and get out of my sight before I find
    another assignment for you.
  - All targets sorted. The High Council will be thrilled with MY leadership. You
    may have one complementary hydration cube.
  - We met the deadline! Go clean the engine vents while I attend the executive victory
    banquet.
  _defeatLines:
  - Critical failure ({reason})! Your internship has been terminated and your resume
    has been launched into the nearest star!
  - "End of the line ({reason})! I'm expensing your rescue pod from your final paycheck\u2014which
    is zero!"
  - 'Mission failed: {reason}. If the Federation asks, I have never seen you, spoken
    to you, or signed your work visa.'
  - Total operational collapse ({reason})! I am recommending to the Board that you
    be permanently replaced by a spreadsheet macro!
